<div class="space-y-6 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
  <p>
    StrefaSA is a modern, high-performance marketing platform and integrated shop built for one of Poland's MTA:SA (Multi Theft Auto: San Andreas) communities. As a <span class="text-slate-200 font-bold">co-owner and co-creator</span> of the server, I designed and developed this web ecosystem to bridge the gap between game atmosphere and professional web presence, utilizing <span class="text-slate-200 font-bold">Astro</span> for extremely fast load times and a cinematic user experience.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 pt-4 !mt-10 border-t border-slate-800">
    Product Strategy
  </h3>
  <p>
    The website's primary goal is to convert visitors into active players within 60 seconds. This is achieved through:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 pl-2">
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Cinematic Immersion:</span> A hero section designed to feel like a game title screen, prioritizing atmosphere over raw information at first glance.</li>
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Trust Through Data:</span> Real-time player counts, server status, and activity metrics prove the server's health and reliability.</li>
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Frictionless Entry:</span> A prominent "Copy IP" CTA ensures that the path from landing on the site to joining the server is as short as possible.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 pt-4 !mt-10 border-t border-slate-800">
    E-commerce Integration
  </h3>
  <p>
    The <span class="font-mono text-green-400">/sklep</span> module is a custom-built storefront that integrates with the MTA server's backend.
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2">
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Stripe Checkout:</span> Secure handling of payments, including support for Polish-specific methods like BLIK.</li>
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Automated Delivery:</span> Successful payments trigger webhooks that instantly deliver in-game assets or currency to players.</li>
    <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Product Catalog:</span> Dynamically managed vehicle and item listings with detailed specifications.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 pt-4 !mt-10 border-t border-slate-800">
    Technical Stack
  </h3>
